		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Specter of a woman who froze to death. Garbed in mundane clothes, but blue- lipped and radiates cold.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 18, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 frigid touch +4 (2d6) and blizzard, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> -4, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Blizzard</strong>. Surrounded by freezing fog and snow in a far area around spirit.</p><p></p><p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Incorporeal</strong>. In place of attacks, become corporeal or incorporeal.</p><p></p><p><strong>Snow Spirit</strong>. Takes 1d6 damage per round if in an area without snow.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
